{"title": "AxEvent type", "source": "adaptix", "source_label": "Adaptix C2", "path": "development/axscript/axevent-type", "html": "<blockquote>\n<p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://adaptix-framework.gitbook.io/adaptix-framework/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to page URLs; this page is available as <a href=\"https://adaptix-framework.gitbook.io/adaptix-framework/development/axscript/axevent-type.md\">Markdown</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 id=\"axevent-type\">AxEvent type</h1>\n<p>AdaptixClient generates events for various situations. To register a handler for a specific event, there are functions from the <code>event</code> namespace. Several handlers can be connected to one event.</p>\n<p>To assign a <code>handler</code> to a specific event use the function</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_EVENT_TYPE</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">agents</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">os</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">listeners</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>handler</code> - a handler that will be triggered when the event occurs.</li>\n<li><code>agents</code> - a non-empty array of agent type names, such as <code>\"beacon\"</code> or <code>\"gopher\"</code>. An empty array is an error and the handler is not registered.</li>\n<li><code>os</code> - operating system names: <code>\"windows\"</code>, <code>\"linux\"</code>, <code>\"macos\"</code>. An empty array registers the handler for every operating system.</li>\n<li><code>listeners</code> - listener type names, such as <code>\"BeaconHTTP\"</code> or <code>\"BeaconSMB\"</code>. An empty array registers the handler for every listener.</li>\n<li><code>event_id</code> - id used later by <code>event.remove</code> and <code>event.list</code>. If it is empty, the client assigns one.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These handlers run in the client. On the teamserver every <code>event.on_*</code> is a no-op, <code>event.list</code> returns <code>[]</code>, and <code>event.remove</code> does nothing. The teamserver does have <code>event.emit(string type, text)</code>, which publishes an event and returns <code>true</code>. <code>text</code> may be a string or an object with a <code>text</code> field.</p>\n<p>You can remove a handler that has an id set.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">remove</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_new_agent\">on_new_agent</h2>\n<p>This event occurs every time a new agent registers.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_new_agent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">agents</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">os</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">listeners</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kr\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>id</code> - agent ID</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_ag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">show_message</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;New agent&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_new_agent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_ag</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;beacon&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;gopher&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_filebrowser_disks\">on_filebrowser_disks</h2>\n<p>This event occurs when the user clicks the Disks button in the File Browser.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_filebrowser_disks</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">agents</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">os</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">listeners</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kr\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>id</code> - agent ID</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_disks_action</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">execute_browser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;disks&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_filebrowser_disks</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_disks_action</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;beacon&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_filebrowser_list\">on_filebrowser_list</h2>\n<p>This event occurs whenever the user requests a list of files in the File Browser.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_filebrowser_list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">agents</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">os</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">listeners</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kr\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">path</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>id</code> - agent ID</li>\n<li><code>path</code> - current path in File Browser</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_files_action</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">execute_browser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;ls &quot;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">path</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_filebrowser_list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_files_action</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;beacon&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_filebrowser_upload\">on_filebrowser_upload</h2>\n<p>This event occurs when the user uploads a file in the File Browser.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_filebrowser_upload</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">agents</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">os</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">listeners</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kr\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">filepath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>id</code> - agent ID</li>\n<li><code>path</code> - current path in File Browser</li>\n<li><code>filepath</code> - path to the local file to upload</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_upload_action</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">filepath</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">filename</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">file_basename</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">filepath</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">execute_browser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;upload &quot;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">filepath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot; &quot;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">path</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_filebrowser_upload</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_upload_action</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;beacon&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_processbrowser_list\">on_processbrowser_list</h2>\n<p>This event occurs when the user requests the process list in the Process Browser.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_processbrowser_list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">agents</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">os</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">listeners</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kr\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>id</code> - agent ID</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_process_action</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">execute_browser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;ps list&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_processbrowser_list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_process_action</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;beacon&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_disconnect\">on_disconnect</h2>\n<p>This event occurs when a client disconnects from the server.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_disconnect</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_disc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">show_message</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Event&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Client disconnected!&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_disconnect</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_disc</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_ready\">on_ready</h2>\n<p>This event occurs when the client has finished synchronizing with the server.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_ready</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_ready</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">show_message</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Event&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Client connected!&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_ready</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_ready</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_interval\">on_interval</h2>\n<p>The <code>handler</code> will be executed every <code>n</code> seconds. The method returns the ID with which the event was registered.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_interval</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kr\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">n</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>n</code> — is the period in seconds. A negative value is treated as <code>0</code>. The return value is <code>event_id</code>, or a generated <code>interval_</code> id when <code>event_id</code> is empty. A handler that is not a function returns <code>\"\"</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_timer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">show_message</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Timeout&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;5 seconds out&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_interval</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_timer</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">5</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"on_timeout\">on_timeout</h2>\n<p>The <code>handler</code> will be executed once in <code>n</code> seconds. The method returns the ID with which the event was registered.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_timeout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">(){},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kr\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">n</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>n</code> — is the delay in seconds. A negative value is treated as <code>0</code>. The handler runs once, then the client removes the registration. The return value is <code>event_id</code>, or a generated <code>timeout_</code> id when <code>event_id</code> is empty. A handler that is not a function returns <code>\"\"</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This event must have a <code>handler</code> assigned in the following format.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">handler</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_timer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">ax</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">show_message</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Timeout&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;5 seconds out&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">on_timeout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">event_timer</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">5</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"list\">list</h2>\n<p>The method returns a list of IDs of all registered handlers.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">list</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"remove\">remove</h2>\n<p>The method removes handler for the event whose ID is provided.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ow\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">remove</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event_id</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<div align=\"left\"><figure><img src=\"https://2104178602-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FS8p8XLFtLmf0NkofQvoa%2Fuploads%2Fgit-blob-1d9f7ce11d6c0502fa68aaec577ba3d84893ab56%2FScreenshot_20250828_125336.png?alt=media\" alt=\"\"><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<hr />", "excerpt": "For the complete documentation index, see llms.txt . Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending .md to page URLs; this page is available as Markdown . AxEvent type AdaptixClie", "tags": []}